  "description": "The SelectPdf PDF library for .NET on Linux ARM64 and Docker. This package contains no code: it installs SelectPdf.Universal (HTML to PDF and Word to PDF conversion, PDF creation and editing, redaction, digital signatures, PDF/A and PDF/UA) together with the Chromium engine package for linux-arm64. The engine is bundled, so Docker images need no apt-get. Requires glibc 2.30 or later. For Linux x64, use SelectPdf.Universal.Linux.",
